WEBVTT

01:38.370 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.100 --> 01:43.960
[Episode 9]

01:45.200 --> 01:45.920
Banxia.

01:51.530 --> 01:52.530
Five grams of banxia.

01:58.759 --> 02:00.200
Fifth row, third drawer.

02:01.060 --> 02:02.420
Fifth...

02:06.300 --> 02:06.960
Found it.

02:15.590 --> 02:16.590
These past couple of days,

02:16.790 --> 02:18.790
I've been carefully thinking about

02:18.810 --> 02:20.370
Chi Wangchuan's last words.

02:21.770 --> 02:23.000
What we can be certain of now is

02:23.030 --> 02:24.150
my father is still alive.

02:24.630 --> 02:25.120
It's just that

02:25.120 --> 02:26.680
he was taken by a powerful demon.

02:27.360 --> 02:28.470
But until his dying breath,

02:28.560 --> 02:29.560
he never mentioned

02:29.560 --> 02:30.470
who this demon was,

02:31.200 --> 02:32.800
let alone where it lives.

02:34.120 --> 02:34.800
So, in that case,

02:34.800 --> 02:36.560
we've lost all our leads.

02:38.870 --> 02:39.840
Ten grams of duhuo.

02:45.750 --> 02:47.070
Duhuo...

02:48.560 --> 02:49.190
Found it.

02:52.490 --> 02:54.240
Chi Wangchuan also said

02:54.910 --> 02:56.960
my father had borrowed a life from a demon before,

02:57.560 --> 02:59.120
intending to fake his death and escape.

02:59.630 --> 03:01.150
But he failed.

03:02.190 --> 03:03.280
Ten grams of chaihu.

03:06.970 --> 03:08.940
Chaihu...

03:11.400 --> 03:12.340
Chaihu is in...

03:12.370 --> 03:14.000
The fifth drawer of the second row from the top.

03:14.570 --> 03:16.850
Second from the top...

03:20.870 --> 03:21.520
Found it.

03:25.030 --> 03:26.870
So now the question is,

03:27.560 --> 03:29.430
what exactly is this life-exchanging demon

03:29.450 --> 03:30.410
he mentioned?

03:31.360 --> 03:32.710
If he dared to lend his life,

03:32.910 --> 03:33.360
it means

03:33.360 --> 03:34.980
he had a way to get out unscathed.

03:36.030 --> 03:36.520
So, does that mean

03:36.520 --> 03:37.980
if we find him,

03:38.120 --> 03:39.630
we can find out my father's whereabouts?

03:42.070 --> 03:43.420
Haven't you forgotten something?

03:45.000 --> 03:45.870
What is it?

03:46.710 --> 03:48.030
Didn't I tell you before?

03:48.600 --> 03:49.950
We demon hunters work

03:49.980 --> 03:51.140
for payment.

03:51.520 --> 03:52.590
I can help you,

03:52.840 --> 03:53.800
but you must pay me.

03:55.120 --> 03:56.000
One thousand taels of silver.

03:56.950 --> 03:58.400
But when you caught Manniang

03:58.430 --> 03:59.470
and Chi Wangchuan before,

04:00.030 --> 04:01.190
I didn't see you charging any silver.

04:02.080 --> 04:03.190
Lord Geng of Guangping Prefecture

04:03.190 --> 04:04.280
once helped me.

04:04.870 --> 04:05.800
I promised him

04:06.120 --> 04:07.470
that as long as he's in Guangping,

04:07.750 --> 04:09.660
I'll keep the people under his rule safe.

04:11.590 --> 04:12.190
Well, I'm also

04:12.190 --> 04:13.400
one of the people under his rule.

04:13.840 --> 04:14.630
Besides,

04:14.910 --> 04:16.240
I've helped you before.

04:16.800 --> 04:17.829
If it weren't for me,

04:18.160 --> 04:19.950
how could you have caught the Mirror Demon so quickly?

04:25.310 --> 04:25.910
Don't go.

04:30.680 --> 04:32.040
Why are there so many bugs?

04:32.360 --> 04:33.360
So many bugs!

04:35.560 --> 04:36.680
There are bugs here.

04:37.870 --> 04:38.360
No, no.

04:40.240 --> 04:40.720
Hey,

04:40.830 --> 04:42.270
why are there so many bugs?

04:42.870 --> 04:43.750
These are called Moon Bugs.

04:44.070 --> 04:45.390
They're specifically for dealing with demons.

04:45.409 --> 04:46.680
Haven't you seen them before?

05:01.600 --> 05:03.750
W-Why do you have bugs

05:03.830 --> 05:04.920
in your pharmacy?

05:07.920 --> 05:08.630
Are you scared?

05:13.880 --> 05:14.830
Stop laughing.

05:16.560 --> 05:17.920
Since you're so afraid of bugs,

05:18.120 --> 05:19.090
don't touch my things

05:19.120 --> 05:20.040
carelessly.

05:23.360 --> 05:25.430
I-I'm not scared, I just...

05:26.050 --> 05:27.570
I've never seen anything like this before.

05:29.190 --> 05:30.630
Why do they glow?

05:31.040 --> 05:33.000
Moon Bugs feed on moonlight.

05:33.310 --> 05:34.360
Of course they glow.

05:35.070 --> 05:36.680
They feed on moonlight?

05:43.870 --> 05:45.720
Then what's that in your hand?

05:45.970 --> 05:47.580
They occasionally eat some

05:47.600 --> 05:49.090
fish gills and sheep lungs.

05:53.190 --> 05:54.920
Strange bugs raised by a strange person.

06:03.520 --> 06:04.250
How about

06:05.210 --> 06:07.010
you lend me that book to read?

06:08.700 --> 06:09.460
What book?

06:10.270 --> 06:12.280
The one you lent to Wen Jian last time,

06:12.600 --> 06:14.160
the Hundred Demon Catalog.

06:14.920 --> 06:16.190
I often see demons.

06:17.270 --> 06:18.430
If I read up on them beforehand,

06:18.920 --> 06:19.600
at least next time

06:19.600 --> 06:20.720
I won't be so panicked.

06:21.190 --> 06:21.870
No.

06:22.800 --> 06:23.980
W-Why not?

06:24.190 --> 06:25.000
Xuanye!

06:26.070 --> 06:26.630
Xuanye!

06:27.920 --> 06:28.600
Mrs. Song.

06:29.360 --> 06:30.240
I just passed by

06:30.480 --> 06:31.190
the vegetable garden.

06:31.390 --> 06:32.270
I saw Ms. Cui

06:32.270 --> 06:33.750
fainted in her yard again.

06:33.870 --> 06:34.830
You'd better go check on her quickly.

06:36.240 --> 06:36.870
Let's go.

06:59.510 --> 07:00.270
Physician Jiu.

07:00.600 --> 07:01.360
Ms. Cui,

07:01.950 --> 07:02.630
are you feeling better?

07:03.820 --> 07:05.580
Did I faint again just now?

07:07.510 --> 07:08.000
Yes.

07:08.310 --> 07:09.390
You haven't fully recovered

07:09.600 --> 07:10.480
from your palpitations yet.

07:10.950 --> 07:12.270
You still need to continue taking the medicine.

07:13.270 --> 07:13.870
I've already

07:13.870 --> 07:14.870
written some prescriptions for you.

07:15.190 --> 07:15.830
In a bit,

07:15.950 --> 07:17.040
Chi Xue will bring them over.

07:17.330 --> 07:19.670
[Ms. Cui]

07:21.600 --> 07:22.190
Also...

07:27.830 --> 07:28.560
This too.

07:28.800 --> 07:29.720
I can't accept this.

07:30.000 --> 07:31.040
I haven't used up the money

07:31.040 --> 07:31.950
you gave me last time.

07:32.240 --> 07:32.830
Ms. Cui,

07:33.190 --> 07:34.000
don't be so polite.

07:34.310 --> 07:35.510
This is all part of my duty.

07:38.550 --> 07:39.400
Thank you.

07:41.830 --> 07:42.790
Then I'll take my leave now.

07:53.330 --> 07:55.420
Who was that Ms. Cui?

07:56.770 --> 07:58.180
The wife of my shop assistant.

07:58.830 --> 08:00.510
You don't have any shop assistants.

08:03.310 --> 08:04.000
So,

08:04.120 --> 08:04.950
as you can see,

08:05.850 --> 08:06.850
I'm not very popular.

08:07.120 --> 08:08.800
The pharmacy hardly has any business.

08:09.310 --> 08:11.070
The government jobs rarely pay.

08:11.370 --> 08:12.760
And I have several families to support.

08:13.750 --> 08:14.720
You're asking for my help

08:14.960 --> 08:16.520
and you still have the nerve to bargain with me?

08:17.720 --> 08:18.600
It's mainly because

08:18.600 --> 08:20.070
that 1,000 taels you're asking for is too much.

08:20.480 --> 08:21.190
How about this?

08:21.870 --> 08:23.360
I'll pay you a part first.

08:23.380 --> 08:24.000
When you

08:24.000 --> 08:25.070
find my father later,

08:25.240 --> 08:26.160
have him pay you.

08:26.360 --> 08:27.360
He has a lot of money.

08:37.549 --> 08:39.169
Move aside! Quickly, move aside!

08:48.150 --> 08:49.440
Make way! Make way! Make way!

08:50.030 --> 08:50.550
Make way!

08:51.920 --> 08:53.370
[Gao Sheng]

08:59.600 --> 09:00.930
He seems to be dead.

09:16.790 --> 09:17.360
Chief Constable Wen.

09:18.200 --> 09:18.750
Are you done?

09:19.820 --> 09:20.230
Yes.

09:21.000 --> 09:21.600
Thank you.

09:22.960 --> 09:23.550
Let's go.

09:26.080 --> 09:27.130
That was really dangerous.

09:27.390 --> 09:28.440
You weren't scared, were you?

09:29.320 --> 09:30.330
How is that person

09:30.350 --> 09:31.110
who was hit?

09:31.960 --> 09:33.000
Even Xuanye couldn't save him.

09:33.320 --> 09:33.790
He died on the spot.

09:33.790 --> 09:34.720
Hurry up. Behave yourself.

09:37.270 --> 09:37.870
Behave yourself.

09:38.930 --> 09:40.240
It's you again,

09:40.510 --> 09:41.600
Mr. Gao?

09:42.360 --> 09:42.910
Hello.

09:47.040 --> 09:47.590
Where's the lord?

09:48.870 --> 09:49.480
In the back courtyard.

09:50.920 --> 09:51.440
Take him away.

09:52.240 --> 09:52.790
Quickly.

10:03.420 --> 10:04.600
How will that person be sentenced?

10:05.630 --> 10:06.550
Recklessly riding a horse on the street,

10:06.710 --> 10:07.590
taking someone's life…

10:08.120 --> 10:09.480
It isn't the first time this bastard did this.

10:09.730 --> 10:10.970
Lord Geng won't let him off easily.

10:12.310 --> 10:13.040
It's getting late.

10:13.960 --> 10:14.670
You two should head back first.

10:15.000 --> 10:15.720
I'll work for a while longer.

10:19.290 --> 10:20.410
About your father's matter,

10:20.560 --> 10:21.400
I've kept it in mind.

10:22.200 --> 10:22.790
But this matter

10:22.790 --> 10:23.630
isn't something that can be resolved

10:23.630 --> 10:24.630
overnight.

10:25.100 --> 10:26.370
You don't need to keep rushing me every day.

10:27.750 --> 10:28.870
You don't want the money anymore?

10:35.670 --> 10:37.470
I'm not trying to rush you.

10:37.650 --> 10:39.630
As the saying goes,

10:39.720 --> 10:40.690
two heads

10:40.720 --> 10:41.630
are better than one.

10:42.960 --> 10:44.630
I want to discuss something with you.

10:44.660 --> 10:45.760
Shouldn't we

10:45.780 --> 10:47.710
start investigating this life-swapping demon first?

10:48.270 --> 10:49.360
Tell me, what exactly is this

10:49.360 --> 10:50.720
life-swapping demon?

10:51.410 --> 10:52.840
Why is he so bold?

10:53.030 --> 10:54.240
He doesn't even fear death.

10:54.290 --> 10:54.890
Alright.

10:55.320 --> 10:56.440
Stop talking about it.

10:56.830 --> 10:57.800
I'm already home.

10:57.910 --> 10:58.670
You should go back now.

10:59.200 --> 11:00.270
If there's any progress on the matter,

11:00.470 --> 11:01.280
I'll let you know.

11:03.240 --> 11:04.790
Then, tomorrow...

11:21.120 --> 11:22.870
My Lady, where have you been? I...

11:25.600 --> 11:26.270
Young Master.

11:29.150 --> 11:29.720
Yanqiu.

11:30.630 --> 11:31.150
Have a seat.

11:35.360 --> 11:36.150
Would you like some tea?

11:38.150 --> 11:39.440
Let's not rush to drink tea.

11:41.320 --> 11:42.270
I have something to ask you.

11:45.510 --> 11:47.120
Why were you with him?

11:48.480 --> 11:49.240
Who?

11:49.840 --> 11:51.030
The one living next door to you.

11:53.510 --> 11:54.840
My father was taken by a demon.

11:55.240 --> 11:56.330
None of you believed me.

11:56.360 --> 11:57.240
I could only turn to him.

11:57.480 --> 11:58.480
Is he a good person or a bad person?

11:58.480 --> 11:59.240
Do you know?

12:00.320 --> 12:01.600
You trust him just like that?

12:08.390 --> 12:09.670
Did you know Grandmother is ill?

12:12.080 --> 12:13.150
The doctor has visited.

12:14.000 --> 12:15.440
He said it's due to excessive worry

12:16.240 --> 12:17.270
and depression in her heart.

12:18.150 --> 12:19.000
How could this be?

12:19.000 --> 12:20.430
She was fine when I left.

12:20.460 --> 12:22.130
Yes, that was when you left.

12:22.870 --> 12:23.750
You left home

12:23.750 --> 12:24.750
without a word.

12:25.150 --> 12:26.870
You haven't even sent a letter.

12:27.440 --> 12:29.000
Grandmother is already over 70.

12:29.270 --> 12:30.750
She just experienced the pain of losing a son,

12:30.950 --> 12:32.200
and now she has to worry about you all day.

12:32.630 --> 12:33.510
She can't eat or drink.

12:33.510 --> 12:34.500
She cries every day.

12:34.640 --> 12:35.530
How could she not fall ill?

12:43.630 --> 12:44.320
Banxia,

12:45.440 --> 12:46.910
you weren't like this before.

12:47.390 --> 12:48.360
Among the sisters in the family,

12:48.480 --> 12:49.960
you were the most obedient and gentle.

12:50.670 --> 12:51.120
But now,

12:51.120 --> 12:51.790
how could you do

12:51.790 --> 12:53.350
such an unfilial thing?

12:53.840 --> 12:55.390
You ran away from home before

12:55.600 --> 12:56.720
Uncle Yingheng's mourning period had even passed.

12:57.510 --> 12:59.030
Being a young woman alone out there,

12:59.320 --> 12:59.890
how can your family

12:59.910 --> 13:01.070
not worry about you?

13:02.080 --> 13:03.690
I know I was wrong this time,

13:04.030 --> 13:05.360
but I had no choice.

13:07.360 --> 13:08.390
What do you want me to believe?

13:08.960 --> 13:09.670
Should I believe in your so-called

13:09.670 --> 13:11.170
tales of monsters and ghosts,

13:11.750 --> 13:12.600
or should I believe that Uncle Yingheng

13:12.600 --> 13:13.600
can come back from the dead?

13:14.360 --> 13:15.510
My father is not dead.

13:15.510 --> 13:16.390
I've already found some clues.

13:16.390 --> 13:17.120
Enough!

13:22.240 --> 13:22.960
Pack your things.

13:23.650 --> 13:25.010
Come back with me immediately.

13:26.170 --> 13:26.840
I'm not leaving.

13:31.360 --> 13:32.270
You've already turned the household

13:32.270 --> 13:32.960
into a mess.

13:32.960 --> 13:34.000
What more do you want?

13:38.240 --> 13:39.390
You must come back with me today.

13:39.840 --> 13:40.570
I'm not leaving. Tingzhou!

13:40.600 --> 13:41.150
I won't go.

13:41.150 --> 13:41.970
-My Lady!
-Let go of me!

13:43.030 --> 13:43.940
Young Master,

13:44.510 --> 13:45.670
please believe her.

13:46.320 --> 13:47.410
I didn't believe it at first either.

13:47.440 --> 13:48.030
Get out of the way.

13:48.080 --> 13:48.720
I'm not leaving.

13:48.720 --> 13:49.200
Don't pull me.

13:49.200 --> 13:49.750
My Lady!

13:53.910 --> 13:54.840
Do you need any help?

13:56.380 --> 13:58.170
These are all the files

13:58.200 --> 13:59.080
of the throat-slitting case.

13:59.590 --> 14:00.520
You can take a look.

14:01.720 --> 14:02.900
Why do you have

14:03.250 --> 14:04.570
official case files?

14:05.670 --> 14:06.870
I handled the case,

14:07.290 --> 14:08.360
so I was able to borrow them.

14:09.320 --> 14:10.200
Moreover,

14:10.670 --> 14:12.270
you are also a government official,

14:12.670 --> 14:14.240
and had a close relationship with the criminal.

14:14.550 --> 14:15.670
So there's no need to be secretive.

14:27.030 --> 14:28.080
Three years ago, Qu Manniang

14:28.080 --> 14:29.150
came to Guangping.

14:29.790 --> 14:31.150
In just three short years,

14:31.440 --> 14:33.080
she committed 23 murders.

14:33.790 --> 14:34.910
The victims included men and women,

14:35.340 --> 14:36.370
old and young.

14:36.670 --> 14:38.360
Most of them were people with beautiful voices.

14:39.720 --> 14:41.320
She had many identities in her daily life:

14:41.670 --> 14:42.550
singer, dancer,

14:42.790 --> 14:43.790
merchant, tourist.

14:44.270 --> 14:45.120
Her last crime

14:45.150 --> 14:46.480
in Guangping

14:46.960 --> 14:48.440
was luring and killing a child.

14:49.820 --> 14:51.740
Lord Geng from the government office asked me to intervene.

14:52.000 --> 14:53.150
I confronted her.

14:53.720 --> 14:54.550
She was no match for me,

14:54.630 --> 14:55.670
so she fled to Nanyang.

14:56.720 --> 14:57.750
In Nanyang City,

14:58.130 --> 14:58.880
she disguised herself as

14:58.910 --> 15:00.000
a ventriloquist performer.

15:00.600 --> 15:01.670
Her skills were astonishing,

15:02.200 --> 15:03.150
causing quite a stir

15:03.150 --> 15:04.030
in the city.

15:05.150 --> 15:06.120
And then,

15:06.670 --> 15:08.120
she met you, Lord Duan.

15:11.000 --> 15:12.140
This is absurd.

15:13.390 --> 15:14.840
Manniang was just a weak woman.

15:15.480 --> 15:16.670
How could she, in a heavily guarded

15:16.670 --> 15:17.360
marquis's mansion,

15:17.360 --> 15:18.480
kill a singer

15:18.840 --> 15:20.240
and take her throat?

15:22.440 --> 15:23.150
And with this one,

15:23.870 --> 15:25.390
how could she subtly cut out

15:25.670 --> 15:27.000
the storyteller's throat

15:27.000 --> 15:28.550
in a hall full of guests?

15:28.840 --> 15:30.390
This is simply a fantasy.

15:31.200 --> 15:33.120
A weak woman certainly couldn't do it.

15:33.320 --> 15:34.030
But she

15:34.240 --> 15:35.600
was not just a weak woman.

15:35.670 --> 15:36.550
What do you mean?

15:38.150 --> 15:38.870
Banxia has already

15:38.870 --> 15:40.270
explained it very clearly to you before.

15:40.410 --> 15:40.930
It's just that you

15:40.960 --> 15:42.200
don't want to believe it.

15:44.510 --> 15:45.150
I was wondering

15:45.150 --> 15:46.600
why Banxia dared to leave home.

15:48.890 --> 15:50.520
It turns out you bewitched her.

15:53.750 --> 15:54.750
Before this,

15:55.360 --> 15:56.600
you sneaked into my residence

15:56.690 --> 15:57.730
and slandered my wife.

15:58.230 --> 15:59.590
Now, you're deceiving my sister.

15:59.630 --> 16:00.840
Who exactly are you?

16:00.840 --> 16:01.500
Yanqiu...

16:01.530 --> 16:01.980
Shut up.

16:03.390 --> 16:04.080
Sister-in-law Manniang

16:04.080 --> 16:05.530
was really a demon, not a human.

16:07.150 --> 16:08.320
The prefectural governor of Guangping Prefecture

16:08.320 --> 16:09.630
and those constables

16:09.800 --> 16:10.840
can all testify to this.

16:10.870 --> 16:12.360
Why won't you believe it?

16:13.750 --> 16:15.320
And my father really isn't dead.

16:15.350 --> 16:16.520
I'm not talking nonsense.

16:16.670 --> 16:17.390
I don't want to

16:17.390 --> 16:18.320
discuss these things with you now.

16:19.530 --> 16:20.410
I came here today

16:20.440 --> 16:21.750
just to take you home.

16:22.790 --> 16:23.750
Grandmother is ill

16:24.000 --> 16:25.480
and everyone at home misses you dearly.

16:25.750 --> 16:27.080
If you still have any sense,

16:27.550 --> 16:28.670
come back with me right now.

16:29.820 --> 16:30.820
I can't go back with you.

16:30.870 --> 16:31.320
You—

16:31.440 --> 16:33.590
Hearing is deceiving. Seeing is believing.

16:34.390 --> 16:35.990
Lord Duan, you're so stubborn.

16:36.200 --> 16:37.600
I don't have the ability to convince you either.

16:38.750 --> 16:39.960
You'd better experience it yourself.

16:41.670 --> 16:42.280
Chi Xue!

16:49.670 --> 16:50.150
Lord Duan.

16:56.740 --> 16:57.580
Steamed buns!

17:01.120 --> 17:01.790
Thank you

17:02.060 --> 17:03.220
for today.

17:07.650 --> 17:08.369
What are you laughing at?

17:09.270 --> 17:11.000
You seem to always be saying that.

17:18.160 --> 17:19.349
Actually, in this world,

17:19.790 --> 17:20.880
most people

17:21.000 --> 17:22.960
don't have the courage to face the truth.

17:23.920 --> 17:24.680
Rather than facing

17:24.680 --> 17:26.069
those bloody facts,

17:26.680 --> 17:28.000
they prefer to believe

17:28.030 --> 17:29.350
what they want to believe.

17:29.880 --> 17:30.830
This is normal.

17:32.200 --> 17:33.590
If your cousin were to believe you,

17:34.110 --> 17:34.920
he would have to believe

17:34.920 --> 17:36.240
that his wife was a demon.

17:37.070 --> 17:38.160
This is difficult for him.

17:40.240 --> 17:40.960
I understand.

17:42.880 --> 17:43.550
So,

17:44.000 --> 17:44.920
cheer up.

17:45.440 --> 17:46.590
Don't look so gloomy.

17:48.830 --> 17:50.160
Are you trying to comfort me?

17:52.550 --> 17:53.270
What do you think?

17:55.920 --> 17:57.200
Then I'll take it as such.

18:17.270 --> 18:18.000
My Lady.

18:21.200 --> 18:22.790
Why is there so little wine in your house?

18:24.200 --> 18:24.920
Put it down.

18:25.710 --> 18:26.680
Put it all down.

18:35.790 --> 18:36.550
Want a drink?

18:38.750 --> 18:39.680
I forgot.

18:41.160 --> 18:42.750
You don't drink.

18:44.440 --> 18:46.160
Father doesn't like to drink either.

18:48.070 --> 18:49.480
In the entire family,

18:51.440 --> 18:53.790
only Manniang would drink with me.

18:59.110 --> 19:00.830
Manniang had an excellent capacity for alcohol,

19:02.270 --> 19:03.400
even better than mine.

19:12.560 --> 19:14.220
Yanqiu, stop drinking.

19:14.240 --> 19:15.080
You're drunk.

19:17.250 --> 19:18.100
Yes,

19:19.380 --> 19:20.070
I'm drunk.

19:21.200 --> 19:22.200
I'm drunk.

19:27.310 --> 19:29.160
When I married Manniang,

19:30.090 --> 19:31.570
everyone in the family disapproved.

19:33.830 --> 19:34.480
They said

19:35.900 --> 19:36.860
her background

19:37.270 --> 19:38.790
wasn't a match for me.

19:40.730 --> 19:41.930
But whether we matched or not,

19:42.440 --> 19:43.610
how would they know?

19:47.270 --> 19:48.310
Only me…

19:50.790 --> 19:52.680
Only I know.

20:00.770 --> 20:02.930
I earned my scholarly honors at 16 years old.

20:04.310 --> 20:05.920
I studied and practiced martial arts,

20:07.790 --> 20:09.160
never slacking off.

20:11.620 --> 20:13.670
I can support myself

20:14.350 --> 20:15.480
and take care of my family.

20:17.240 --> 20:18.590
I don't want those

20:18.970 --> 20:19.920
rich ladies

20:20.160 --> 20:21.640
who come for my family status

20:21.660 --> 20:22.990
and government position.

20:25.920 --> 20:27.240
I only want someone…

20:28.200 --> 20:30.400
Someone who only likes me,

20:32.750 --> 20:34.680
someone who only cares about me.

20:40.480 --> 20:42.270
Manniang was that person.

20:47.470 --> 20:50.400
But I failed to protect her.

20:58.880 --> 21:00.350
Yanqiu, she was a demon.

21:01.050 --> 21:02.420
She harmed many people.

21:02.510 --> 21:04.600
But she didn't harm me.

21:06.480 --> 21:07.270
But in the end,

21:07.790 --> 21:08.880
humans and demons are different.

21:10.360 --> 21:12.190
Humans and demons are different.

21:16.350 --> 21:17.000
Yes.

21:18.210 --> 21:20.100
Just as Father said,

21:20.540 --> 21:22.690
when two people are together,

21:23.310 --> 21:26.720
the most important thing is to be of equal social status.

21:28.330 --> 21:29.700
But when two people are together,

21:29.720 --> 21:30.480
isn't the most important thing

21:30.510 --> 21:32.680
that they like each other?

21:48.970 --> 21:49.690
Banxia,

21:55.880 --> 21:56.960
when she died...

22:01.480 --> 22:02.650
Was it painful?

22:12.030 --> 22:13.830
It probably wasn't painful.

22:18.920 --> 22:19.750
That's good then.

22:22.070 --> 22:23.160
That's good.

22:33.790 --> 22:34.510
Yanqiu,

22:38.090 --> 22:39.640
when Sister-in-law was dying,

22:39.990 --> 22:41.110
she asked me to tell you

22:46.880 --> 22:48.680
that she truly liked you.

22:49.400 --> 22:50.720
She never intended to harm you.

22:54.400 --> 22:55.030
I know.

22:57.970 --> 22:59.100
I know.

23:13.270 --> 23:13.920
Tell me.

23:17.920 --> 23:18.720
If I had

23:18.720 --> 23:20.350
met her earlier,

23:21.680 --> 23:22.640
stopped her sooner,

23:23.720 --> 23:24.720
and discovered earlier,

23:25.440 --> 23:26.920
would she have,

23:28.310 --> 23:29.310
for my sake, given up her murderous thoughts

23:29.860 --> 23:30.990
and stopped doing evil?

23:34.400 --> 23:35.400
Could things have been

23:38.240 --> 23:39.920
different between us?

23:48.310 --> 23:49.480
A sunken ship can be salvaged,

23:50.110 --> 23:51.160
but spilled water cannot be gathered.

23:52.680 --> 23:53.790
The dead are gone.

23:54.240 --> 23:55.110
Thinking more is useless.

24:01.030 --> 24:02.400
Different.

24:03.920 --> 24:05.480
Different.

24:10.880 --> 24:13.240
Different.

24:20.830 --> 24:23.400
Different.

24:24.720 --> 24:25.440
Yanqiu.

24:26.440 --> 24:27.510
Different.

24:27.960 --> 24:28.590
Tingzhou!

24:29.270 --> 24:29.960
Tingzhou!

24:32.000 --> 24:33.000
Help me lift him up.

24:33.510 --> 24:34.110
Alright.

24:38.160 --> 24:39.240
My Lady.

24:39.800 --> 24:41.600
Why don't I go find Chi Xue for help?

24:42.650 --> 24:44.220
It's so late. He's probably asleep.

24:44.700 --> 24:45.410
He won't.

24:45.580 --> 24:46.310
I'll go check.

25:15.080 --> 25:15.690
Physician Jiu.

25:17.610 --> 25:18.130
My Lady.

25:21.680 --> 25:22.550
Why are you here?

25:23.910 --> 25:24.460
Why else?

25:26.480 --> 25:27.350
Where's Chi Xue?

25:28.530 --> 25:29.400
Apparently he went out.

25:35.020 --> 25:36.060
Tingzhou, grab his hand.

25:41.640 --> 25:42.440
Careful, careful.

25:42.680 --> 25:43.240
This way.

25:50.720 --> 25:51.920
Thank you for today.

25:52.720 --> 25:53.750
Let me walk you out.

26:07.680 --> 26:08.960
I have something for you.

26:13.350 --> 26:14.270
What's this?

26:15.720 --> 26:16.920
Didn't you catch a cold?

26:18.700 --> 26:19.590
Thank you.

26:21.700 --> 26:22.570
I'll go back now.

26:23.440 --> 26:24.610
You have some gray hair?

26:28.750 --> 26:29.240
It's fine.

26:30.310 --> 26:31.400
You can't see it yourself.

26:32.010 --> 26:33.560
Let's buy some black beans tomorrow

26:33.590 --> 26:34.110
to make bean dye.

26:34.110 --> 26:35.270
Then I'll dye your hair when we get back.

26:36.680 --> 26:37.750
You know how to dye hair?

26:38.720 --> 26:39.640
When I was at home,

26:39.640 --> 26:40.640
I often dyed my father's hair.

26:42.720 --> 26:43.160
Alright.

26:43.350 --> 26:44.200
Do as you please.

26:46.640 --> 26:47.270
My Lady,

26:48.070 --> 26:49.590
I think Physician Jiu likes you.

26:53.510 --> 26:54.640
Why do you say that?

26:55.440 --> 26:56.400
I just went next door.

26:56.400 --> 26:57.750
I clearly saw Chi Xue,

26:58.040 --> 26:59.430
but he said Chi Xue wasn't home.

26:59.450 --> 27:00.820
He insisted on coming over to help himself.

27:01.920 --> 27:02.880
Really?

27:03.310 --> 27:04.440
It's absolutely true.

27:04.920 --> 27:05.920
Chi Xue revealed his true form.

27:05.920 --> 27:07.270
He turned into a rabbit and was gnawing on shoes.

27:07.400 --> 27:08.350
I saw it all.

27:11.790 --> 27:12.550
My Lady,

27:14.110 --> 27:15.790
do you think we could

27:16.440 --> 27:17.830
take a little advantage of this?

27:18.270 --> 27:19.070
We could coax Physician Jiu

27:19.110 --> 27:20.200
to help us find Master.

27:21.160 --> 27:22.090
Don't talk nonsense.

27:22.790 --> 27:23.680
There's no need for that.

27:23.900 --> 27:24.990
He has already agreed to help.

27:25.130 --> 27:25.780
Really?

27:26.720 --> 27:27.270
Alright,

27:27.640 --> 27:28.960
let's leave it at that.

27:29.270 --> 27:31.000
Don't let anyone else know about this.

27:31.640 --> 27:32.440
Otherwise,

27:32.440 --> 27:33.680
it will be awkward when we meet.

27:34.160 --> 27:35.640
Of course I won't say anything.

27:36.550 --> 27:37.070
My Lady,

27:37.070 --> 27:39.240
you're already betrothed.

27:39.300 --> 27:40.530
There's no possibility with him.

27:43.550 --> 27:44.420
But it's true,

27:44.750 --> 27:46.270
Xuanye is very nice to me.

27:47.350 --> 27:48.590
Who can deny that?

28:01.830 --> 28:02.370
Xuanye,

28:02.480 --> 28:03.030
I'm back.

28:04.110 --> 28:05.310
I bought some snacks. Would you like some?

28:07.240 --> 28:07.920
Chi Xue.

28:08.860 --> 28:09.730
What's this?

28:12.590 --> 28:13.920
This is my pet.

28:20.160 --> 28:21.640
It's so cute!

28:21.640 --> 28:23.070
Xuanye, can I keep it?

28:24.400 --> 28:25.550
Your pet?

28:28.350 --> 28:29.270
You can't keep it.

28:38.000 --> 28:39.070
Prisoner Gao Sheng.

28:40.380 --> 28:42.380
I've reviewed your past records.

28:43.110 --> 28:44.060
Three years ago,

28:44.370 --> 28:46.540
you drunkenly rode your horse into the fields

28:46.700 --> 28:47.270
and injured

28:47.300 --> 28:49.060
a Mrs. Zhang who was working there.

28:49.820 --> 28:50.660
Mrs. Zhang

28:50.810 --> 28:52.290
was pregnant at the time.

28:53.160 --> 28:54.070
And a year ago,

28:54.590 --> 28:55.720
in the market,

28:55.930 --> 28:57.640
you deliberately rode your horse over and broke

28:57.660 --> 28:59.180
the leg of a beggar.

28:59.550 --> 29:01.720
You truly never learn, do you?

29:02.950 --> 29:04.100
Yesterday,

29:04.510 --> 29:06.110
again in the market,

29:06.350 --> 29:07.960
you deliberately rode your horse to commit a crime

29:08.030 --> 29:09.720
and killed a passerby named Wang Zi'an.

29:10.240 --> 29:11.240
Do you plead guilty?

29:13.960 --> 29:14.720
I was drunk.

29:15.000 --> 29:15.640
It was unintentional.

29:16.380 --> 29:17.110
Unintentional?

29:19.680 --> 29:20.750
All these incidents

29:21.070 --> 29:22.550
have witness testimonies.

29:23.930 --> 29:24.970
Take a close look.

29:25.200 --> 29:25.960
Is there

29:26.180 --> 29:27.340
a single word

29:27.720 --> 29:28.640
that wrongly accuses you?

29:36.720 --> 29:37.350
My Lord,

29:37.640 --> 29:38.510
there's no need for a trial.

29:38.710 --> 29:39.790
I plead guilty, alright?

29:40.070 --> 29:41.160
How much money do they want?

29:41.310 --> 29:42.200
I'll pay it all.

29:44.310 --> 29:46.000
Paying compensation is a given.

29:46.590 --> 29:47.310
However,

29:47.550 --> 29:48.880
you must also pay with your life.

29:52.290 --> 29:52.810
My Lord,

29:53.460 --> 29:55.390
I was drunk, and so are you now.

29:55.680 --> 29:57.480
You're not new to Guangping.

29:57.920 --> 29:59.960
Don't you know about the Gao family?

30:02.680 --> 30:03.240
My Lord,

30:04.350 --> 30:05.240
this is

30:05.260 --> 30:07.330
the son of Deputy Gao, the wealthy landowner from the east of the city.

30:08.100 --> 30:09.190
He has a sister

30:09.440 --> 30:11.490
who entered Prince Xiang's household three years ago

30:11.740 --> 30:12.570
as a concubine.

30:13.160 --> 30:14.400
She has given birth to three sons

30:14.880 --> 30:16.030
and is highly favored.

30:17.310 --> 30:18.310
My Lord, rest assured,

30:18.640 --> 30:20.570
I will pay every cent of compensation due.

30:20.830 --> 30:22.000
I won't put you in a difficult position.

30:22.160 --> 30:23.960
I'll also spend a few days in jail.

30:24.160 --> 30:24.920
Just consider it

30:25.240 --> 30:26.590
as penance for my sins.

30:29.050 --> 30:29.970
If you want to

30:30.110 --> 30:31.630
truly repent and atone for your sins,

30:31.850 --> 30:32.720
then go to the underworld

30:33.230 --> 30:34.900
and tell it to the deceased.

30:35.510 --> 30:36.070
Guards!

30:36.680 --> 30:37.110
Yes, sir.

30:37.830 --> 30:38.880
Prisoner Gao Sheng,

30:39.170 --> 30:40.590
for deliberately using your horse to commit a crime,

30:40.610 --> 30:41.890
you will be imprisoned

30:42.010 --> 30:42.970
according to our dynasty's laws

30:43.000 --> 30:44.240
and executed after autumn.

30:44.510 --> 30:45.030
Yes, sir.

30:46.480 --> 30:47.000
Go.

30:48.160 --> 30:49.030
How dare you!

30:49.140 --> 30:50.590
My brother-in-law is a prince of the current dynasty.

30:50.640 --> 30:51.440
You dare to touch me?

30:51.830 --> 30:53.370
My sister will be back in a few days.

30:54.570 --> 30:55.610
Well, Mr. Gao,

30:55.830 --> 30:58.040
when exactly is your sister returning?

30:58.070 --> 30:59.000
She'll be back in three days.

31:03.210 --> 31:04.160
In that case,

31:05.440 --> 31:06.640
you will be executed immediately

31:06.750 --> 31:07.920
tomorrow at noon.

31:08.590 --> 31:09.070
Take him away.

31:09.400 --> 31:09.920
Yes, sir.

31:09.920 --> 31:10.800
How dare you!

31:10.900 --> 31:12.380
My brother-in-law won't let you off the hook.

31:12.720 --> 31:13.750
He won't spare you.

31:14.310 --> 31:14.640
Go!

31:15.340 --> 31:16.030
Don't worry.

31:16.310 --> 31:17.510
I will take good care of Grandmother.

31:18.440 --> 31:19.400
Be extra careful

31:20.350 --> 31:21.240
staying here.

31:21.750 --> 31:22.590
Find Uncle Yingheng soon

31:23.000 --> 31:23.720
and return home for a family reunion.

31:27.300 --> 31:27.700
I was

31:27.720 --> 31:28.870
blind to your greatness before.

31:29.070 --> 31:30.450
Thank you, Jiu, for not holding a grudge.

31:30.680 --> 31:31.410
I will remember

31:31.680 --> 31:32.640
your kindness in my heart.

31:33.110 --> 31:34.030
I will surely repay you generously in the future.

31:35.270 --> 31:37.000
Banxia grew up in seclusion since childhood.

31:37.350 --> 31:38.550
She knows nothing about social norms.

31:39.480 --> 31:40.310
Regarding Uncle Yingheng's matter,

31:40.680 --> 31:41.680
I'll need to trouble you, Jiu.

31:48.640 --> 31:49.720
Take care on your journey.

31:51.680 --> 31:52.380
Take good care of yourself.

32:09.920 --> 32:10.480
Banxia.

32:11.720 --> 32:12.720
Come with me for a moment.

32:18.970 --> 32:19.720
I told you so.

32:29.370 --> 32:29.980
Sit down.

32:31.270 --> 32:32.200
What's the matter?

32:37.180 --> 32:38.030
Try this.

32:38.200 --> 32:38.920
Chi Xue bought this

32:38.920 --> 32:40.000
last night.

32:40.640 --> 32:42.310
He bought it when your cousin was drunk

32:42.330 --> 32:42.960
and Tingzhou came to me

32:42.960 --> 32:44.310
to ask for help.

32:44.790 --> 32:45.640
It tastes pretty good.

32:45.640 --> 32:47.040
You can try it.

32:49.160 --> 32:49.790
Okay.

32:57.310 --> 32:58.310
What's that sound?

33:16.400 --> 33:17.510
Chi Xue's pet rabbit.

33:19.880 --> 33:21.640
Isn't he a rabbit demon himself?

33:21.840 --> 33:23.010
Why would he raise rabbits?

33:23.960 --> 33:24.590
Indeed.

33:25.070 --> 33:25.920
I don't know either.

33:26.590 --> 33:27.440
Maybe

33:27.680 --> 33:28.880
he's raising a wife for himself.

33:34.240 --> 33:34.960
So,

33:35.480 --> 33:36.200
do you understand now?

33:37.880 --> 33:38.480
What?

33:40.440 --> 33:41.160
You don't understand?

33:46.440 --> 33:47.080
Do you like it?

33:47.110 --> 33:47.910
If you like it, it's yours.

33:54.070 --> 33:54.790
My Lady.

33:55.960 --> 33:56.960
Chi Xue?

33:58.000 --> 33:59.350
It's Chi Xue's wife.

34:03.350 --> 34:04.510
Wife?

34:25.150 --> 34:26.360
He's got some nerve.

34:26.920 --> 34:28.440
He's going to the execution ground tomorrow,

34:28.710 --> 34:29.960
yet he's sleeping so soundly.

34:30.960 --> 34:32.150
He's been yelling all day.

34:32.510 --> 34:34.070
Guess he's passed out from exhaustion.

34:35.510 --> 34:35.960
Let's go.

34:36.510 --> 34:37.030
Let's go.

35:58.030 --> 35:58.960
Serves him right.

35:59.800 --> 36:00.760
Execute him quickly.

36:00.960 --> 36:01.670
How can there be such a person?

36:01.920 --> 36:02.710
He's too despicable.

36:08.590 --> 36:09.070
This guy,

36:09.070 --> 36:10.260
wasn't he cursing happily yesterday?

36:10.700 --> 36:11.620
Why is he so quiet today?

36:14.630 --> 36:15.710
Maybe he's tired from all the cursing.

36:17.230 --> 36:18.440
Our Lord Geng is quite bold,

36:18.960 --> 36:19.880
even daring to touch

36:19.900 --> 36:20.450
Prince Xiang's brother-in-law.

36:23.000 --> 36:23.800
Then do you know

36:24.610 --> 36:25.290
whose brother-in-law

36:25.590 --> 36:26.710
our lord is?

36:27.550 --> 36:28.030
Whose?

36:31.710 --> 36:32.710
Our lord's surname is Geng

36:33.230 --> 36:35.440
and the Noble Consort's surname is also Geng.

36:45.020 --> 36:46.150
It's half past noon.

36:48.190 --> 36:48.800
Execute.

37:22.280 --> 37:25.230
The corpse is placed in the center of the hall.

37:26.320 --> 37:29.030
I'll show the deceased the way.

37:29.480 --> 37:30.760
I advise the deceased

37:30.800 --> 37:31.800
to not go south.

37:32.530 --> 37:35.410
There's a flaming mountain in the south.

37:35.590 --> 37:38.640
I advise the deceased to not go west.

37:38.840 --> 37:41.920
The west is arid, with thin air.

37:42.070 --> 37:43.840
I advise the deceased,

37:44.070 --> 37:44.760
you should

37:45.070 --> 37:46.190
take the middle path.

37:48.070 --> 37:50.360
Sway and wobble upwards.

38:46.060 --> 38:48.630
[Backyard]

38:48.750 --> 38:49.810
[Moon Teahouse]

38:49.150 --> 38:51.150
Fresh steamed buns just out of the oven.

38:51.800 --> 38:53.480
Fragrant sachets, take a look.

38:56.800 --> 38:57.360
My Lady,

38:57.670 --> 38:58.360
I've bought them.

39:02.630 --> 39:03.430
My Lady,

39:03.960 --> 39:05.040
will currying favor with Physician Jiu like this

39:05.070 --> 39:05.920
be effective?

39:07.670 --> 39:08.590
I don't know either.

39:09.110 --> 39:09.890
What should we do then?

39:09.920 --> 39:11.230
He doesn't want me watching him.

39:11.360 --> 39:13.150
I've noticed he's been very lazy lately.

39:13.590 --> 39:14.480
He doesn't even go out.

39:15.150 --> 39:15.960
He stays at home all day.

39:15.960 --> 39:17.510
How can he help us investigate the case?

39:19.190 --> 39:20.150
What if

39:20.590 --> 39:22.510
he only cares about official matters

39:22.880 --> 39:23.550
and doesn't take our affairs

39:23.550 --> 39:24.840
seriously at all? What should we do?

39:25.840 --> 39:26.880
It's a big world.

39:27.510 --> 39:29.190
He's definitely not the only demon hunter here.

39:29.670 --> 39:30.630
If worst comes to worst,

39:32.030 --> 39:32.590
we can

39:32.800 --> 39:34.070
look for other options

39:34.230 --> 39:35.670
and find a more powerful demon hunter.

39:36.590 --> 39:37.480
Demon hunter?

39:38.840 --> 39:39.670
Ladies,

39:39.880 --> 39:40.510
I'm afraid you've encountered

39:40.530 --> 39:41.740
something unclean, haven't you?

39:42.410 --> 39:43.330
You should seek out

39:43.350 --> 39:45.000
the half-immortal Kongtongzi.

39:45.920 --> 39:48.070
When it comes to capturing demons and monsters,

39:48.690 --> 39:50.210
and the skill of divination,

39:50.720 --> 39:51.600
if Master Kongtongzi

39:51.630 --> 39:52.420
claims he's second in the world,

39:52.450 --> 39:52.930
I'm afraid

39:53.110 --> 39:54.400
no one would dare claim first.

39:57.200 --> 39:59.300
[Kongtong Temple]

40:18.610 --> 40:19.610
Greetings, Immortal Master.

40:22.080 --> 40:23.490
Last night,

40:23.950 --> 40:25.220
I observed the celestial phenomena.

40:26.130 --> 40:28.640
I saw the universe's energy was clear,

40:29.980 --> 40:31.650
and the Yaoguang star appeared.

40:32.320 --> 40:33.010
I presumed

40:33.510 --> 40:34.660
that distinguished guests would visit.

40:36.590 --> 40:37.550
That must be you, young lady.

40:38.630 --> 40:39.710
Immortal Master, you flatter me.

40:40.710 --> 40:42.590
I've heard that your skills

40:42.800 --> 40:44.110
are unmatched.

40:44.450 --> 40:46.050
I had some doubts at first,

40:46.420 --> 40:47.300
but now that I've seen you,

40:47.400 --> 40:48.920
you truly have the bearings of an immortal.

40:49.840 --> 40:51.030
You understand swordsmanship, young lady?

40:53.150 --> 40:54.000
I don't.

40:54.360 --> 40:55.750
But I read books when I was young.

40:56.080 --> 40:56.970
The books mentioned

40:57.000 --> 40:58.510
a superior technique

40:58.820 --> 40:59.900
called Sparrow Doesn't Fly.

41:00.080 --> 41:01.960
It means that while moving and turning,

41:01.990 --> 41:03.430
one's body is graceful and agile,

41:03.640 --> 41:05.320
yet the shoulders remain as steady as a mountain.

41:05.580 --> 41:07.730
Even if a bird were to land on one's shoulder,

41:08.030 --> 41:09.320
it wouldn't feel any tremor

41:09.320 --> 41:10.070
and wouldn't want to fly away.

41:11.230 --> 41:12.230
I always thought

41:12.230 --> 41:13.360
it was the author's fabrication.

41:13.570 --> 41:14.490
I didn't expect it to be real.

41:18.070 --> 41:19.070
Young lady, may I ask you

41:19.320 --> 41:20.800
what is "Sparrow Doesn't Fly"?

41:24.500 --> 41:25.570
Isn't it right here?

41:31.580 --> 41:33.430
Is this a crow?

41:34.190 --> 41:35.760
Why is it white?

41:36.580 --> 41:38.140
Is this your pet, Immortal Master?

41:40.300 --> 41:42.070
Th-th-this...

41:45.090 --> 41:45.890
She's been seen out?

41:46.510 --> 41:47.710
Master, yes.

41:48.550 --> 41:49.030
Master,

41:49.320 --> 41:50.280
this Ms. Duan

41:50.590 --> 41:51.920
clearly comes from a wealthy family.

41:52.150 --> 41:53.230
She must be very rich.

41:54.000 --> 41:56.000
This fat sheep has been delivered right to our mouths.

41:56.590 --> 41:57.400
We

41:57.600 --> 41:58.930
can't let this opportunity slip away.

42:01.590 --> 42:02.630
We'll see, we'll see.

42:05.430 --> 42:06.780
This girl seems to have some tricks up her sleeve.

42:07.900 --> 42:08.960
She's a bit strange.

42:13.010 --> 42:13.610
Does it hurt a lot?

42:14.350 --> 42:15.120
It doesn't hurt.

42:21.420 --> 42:22.290
It's... it's reconnected?

42:23.190 --> 42:23.760
It's reconnected.

42:25.130 --> 42:26.610
You need to be careful these days.

42:26.880 --> 42:28.630
You can't work or lift heavy objects.

42:29.100 --> 42:30.390
Go home and rest for a few days.

42:31.030 --> 42:31.760
Okay.

42:32.950 --> 42:33.470
Here.

42:34.360 --> 42:35.280
Thank you, Physician Jiu.

42:35.280 --> 42:35.810
You're welcome.

42:35.980 --> 42:36.690
Farewell.

42:41.350 --> 42:42.030
My Lady!

42:42.110 --> 42:42.800
My Lady!

42:43.350 --> 42:44.810
My Lady, wait for me!

42:45.680 --> 42:46.370
Banxia.

42:53.150 --> 42:53.920
Physician Jiu.

42:57.030 --> 42:57.960
Where have you been?

43:00.510 --> 43:01.550
Nothing much.

43:02.150 --> 43:04.030
Just wandering around the streets.

43:06.160 --> 43:08.090
Before, even when I closed the door here,

43:08.370 --> 43:09.600
you would still try to climb over the wall to get in

43:09.620 --> 43:10.260
to take a few peeks.

43:11.230 --> 43:12.280
What's going on today?

43:13.450 --> 43:14.490
Have you done something you feel guilty about?

43:15.800 --> 43:17.510
How could I have done anything to feel guilty about?

43:18.110 --> 43:18.840
We

43:19.400 --> 43:20.770
went to buy black beans.

43:22.360 --> 43:23.150
Black beans?

43:25.360 --> 43:26.360
Didn't we agree to use bean dye

43:26.360 --> 43:27.590
to dye your hair?

43:30.320 --> 43:31.030
Black beans, huh?

43:38.110 --> 43:39.110
What are you holding in your hand?

43:42.980 --> 43:43.770
Let me see.

43:58.350 --> 43:59.780
You went to see Kongtonzi, didn't you?

44:01.960 --> 44:03.630
I just went to take a casual look.

44:05.920 --> 44:06.760
He's a fraud.

44:07.550 --> 44:09.140
Be careful not to be swindled out of everything you own.

44:13.510 --> 44:14.800
What should we do, My Lady?
